  "title": "The Directions Need a Landmark",
  "family": "learning",
  "category": "language/communication",
  "premise": "A visitor wants to find a room, but left-right instructions change meaning when the starting orientation changes. A fixed landmark and a simple route sketch give the visitor a stable reference.",
